== Trivia ==
* In the original ''Binding of Isaac'', this item was known as "Max's Head". Max was a non-existing animal named after the rabbit of [[Edmund McMillen]]'s sister.
** {{Dlc|nr}} The filename for the item icon in the game files still refers to it as "Max's Head".
** According to Edmund's first post-Repentance Lore Stream,<ref>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kby0rXT7qYQ&t=1127s</ref> the reason for the name change is due to the fact that it 'bugged him' to name an item after an animal that did not exist in a game that was written around his life.
* Cricket's Head is named after one of Ed's former cats who is now rehomed, Cricket.
** According to Edmund's first post-Repentance Lore Stream, the reason for re-homing Cricket was that Cricket became increasingly moody after the death of one of Edmund's other cats named [[Guppy]], which involved getting into fights with [[Tammy's Head|Tammy]].
* Although {{i|Cricket's Body}} and Cricket's Head are presumed to be from the same animal, Cricket's Body has darker fur color and spots than Cricket's Head.

